        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/aeb1de/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-12-10T21:07:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another question chaps, from the examples in the starter guide it seems that movement is very abstract, but every now and then an ability refrences movement in some detailed way.</p>\n<p>So my question is in action scenes is movement pretty abstract? characters get to where they need to be, maybe using Overcome actions to do so if needed?</p>\n<p>but as their are movement powers such as Flight, and some abilities mention is movement more crunchy?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:31.336Z",
