        "raw": "<p>Another question chaps, from the examples in the starter guide it seems that movement is very abstract, but every now and then an ability refrences movement in some detailed way.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So my question is in action scenes is movement pretty abstract? characters get to where they need to be, maybe using Overcome actions to do so if needed?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>but as their are movement powers such as Flight, and some abilities mention is movement more crunchy?</p>",
