        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/walkingtarget/{size}/4833_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-12-11T15:01:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Correct, this game does not presume the use of miniatures or anything like the grid that, say, D&amp;D uses. Most RPGs I've played over the years were theater of the mind like this, but we also often got at least some utility out of diagramming out a scene on a tabletop (just with dice or something) to help clarify positioning when necessary, but it rarely if ever had mechanical stuff tied to it.</p>",
