        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/c68b51/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-12-16T19:45:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It seems that there is still a benefit to having movement powers, however -- a character with d6 Flight or d6 Teleportation still has a huge mobility advantage over a character who has to hoof it, unless the GM is totally ignoring that aspect, I'd say.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
